 "about": "The get-up decoder's hip envelope, from hand traces with the servos limp: per leg the hip joint's bounds (model rad) as a piecewise-linear function of the abduction joint (model rad), one 2-deg abduction column per row inside the robust abduction range, each column written at both edges of its cell (piecewise constant). A side is open (+-10 = not limited: the track clamp acts) where the thigh's run from the stand reached its potentiometer's track end, and always at straight abduction; elsewhere it is capped at the traced stop less 3 deg.",
